### Webhook 回调 - 文件移动通知
# 下载工具完成下载并移动到 HDD 后触发

POST http://localhost:8080/api/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file_name": "example.mp4",
  "event": "file_moved"
}


### 规则管理 - 创建规则

POST http://localhost:8080/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "电影 - 所有 mp4 文件",
  "pattern": "*.mp4",
  "target_dir": "/data/media/movies",
  "rename_template": "{title}.{ext}",
  "priority": 10,
  "enabled": true
}

### 规则管理 - 获取所有规则

GET http://localhost:8080/api/rules

### 规则管理 - 获取单条规则

GET http://localhost:8080/api/rules/1

### 规则管理 - 更新规则

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rules/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "电影 - 所有视频文件",
  "pattern": "*.{mp4,mkv,avi}",
  "target_dir": "/data/media/movies",
  "rename_template": "{title}.{ext}",
  "priority": 10,
  "enabled": true
}

### 规则管理 - 删除规则

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rules/1

### 规则管理 - 切换规则启用状态

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/rules/1/toggle
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}
